  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4606.03 Budget Allowances Available for Allocation",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4606.03 Budget Allowances Available for Allocation.\n\n(a) For allocation years 2019 through 2025, the New Hampshire CO2 budget trading program adjusted budget shall be the maximum number of allowances available for allocation in a given allocation year, excluding CO2 offset allowances and CO2 CCR allowances.\n\n(b) For allocation years 2026 through 2030, and each succeeding calendar year, the New Hampshire CO2 budget trading program base budget shall be the maximum number of allowances available for allocation in a given allocation year, excluding CO2 offset allowances and CO2 CCR allowances.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4600.html"
